  "title": "Decomposition view with layered overlay — progetto_ing_software_gr10-main-English",
  "purpose": "Overall organisation of the system: its four layers (Presentation, Application, Domain, Persistence), what each contains and is responsible for, and which layer uses which. Each layer lists its member classes with their responsibilities.",
