  "limitations": [
    "The system has 37 evidenced components (and the reports_db datastore), above the cap of 15 for this detail level, so the view is simplified: one element per layer that lists its member components (decision 'simplify').",
    "Layer membership follows the package names (Boundary, Control, Entity, Database). ReportService and UserService sit in package Entity and are therefore listed under Domain, although their code is application logic that orchestrates persistence.",
    "Relations between layers are counts of component pairs with a code dependency ('<n> dependencies'); the individual dependencies are in evidence_model.json (relations, member_edges).",
    "Presentation uses Domain directly (the enum ReportCategory), which skips the Application layer.",
    "Credentials and Location (embeddable classes) and the persisted attributes of the entities are not shown: the data-structure and data-storage needs are secondary."
  ],
